{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1411292-modern-artifacts","id":1411292,"title":"Modern artifacts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-31T19:50:45-07:00","id":1411292,"title":"Modern artifacts","content":"<span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Artifacts for exalted! Modern. Got any? </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-31T20:38:29-07:00","id":1411293,"title":"","content":"Two dots: Starmetal(?) license plate frame that keeps your plate number from being remembered or recorded or being legibile on camera. Because action movie heroes never have to deal with awkward police visits after their epic car chases and neither should you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","user":"Sith_Happens","date":". 09-01-2020, 03:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T12:24:53-07:00","id":1411407,"title":"","content":"Modern artifacts can be pretty easy to come up with. Take a pretty awesome modern thing and get rid of its weak points.<br /> <br /> Take a smartphone. Now, it always has service, the screen and case can't be damaged, and it is so waterproof you can order a pizza delivery from the bottom of the Great Western Ocean. Also you can resize the screen to be a tablet and flip out a keyboard to be a laptop.<br /> <br /> Take a swiss army knife, except it always has the right tools for the job, you never have to hunt for the right one to flip out, and it closes up with no awkward bits to poke you and easily fits in your hand.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, take a cutting edge technology and make it practical. Example: a cylinder two inches wide and eight inches long that takes in CO2 and produces O2 and an inch thick carbon fiber cable while active.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T05:43:09-07:00","id":1412577,"title":"","content":"Shoes that massively increase sprinting speed for fast getaways and dodging mortal police forces. Lets you run through alleyways and gives you a bonus success for balancing on treacherous places (oil slicks, parkour)<br /> <br /> Mirrorshades that give you a 3D map of your surroundings like you're in an RTS, preventing you from being surrounded or flanked. <br /> <br /> Cyborg implant that lets you download memories and information (ADEI implant)<br /> <br /> A silencer that actually works like in the movies, letting you fire off a machine gun at full auto with nothing more than soft popping sounds. <br /> <br /> Scope that can be fitted anywhere, that lets you fire away your weapon as if you spent several turns aiming. It works even on longbows<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T12:35:53-07:00","id":1412630,"title":"","content":"I've got motorcycles, a surfboard, and... *checks notes* ... sex toys.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://boneandebony.livejournal.com/tag/artifact\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://l-stat.livejournal.net/img/og_image.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://boneandebony.livejournal.com/tag/artifact\" target=\"_blank\"> boneandebony, posts by tag: artifact - LiveJournal </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://boneandebony.livejournal.com/tag/artifact\" target=\"_blank\"> https://boneandebony.livejournal.com/tag/artifact </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Interesting posts by tag: artifact. Read on the LiveJournal blog boneandebony </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T12:51:30-07:00","id":1412631,"title":"","content":"<i>Blinks</i><br /> <br /> <b>Hidden Geisha Orbs</b><br /> <br /> The hell, man?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T12:55:20-07:00","id":1412633,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/are-radioactive-diamond-batteries-a-cure-for-nuclear-waste/\" target=\"_blank\">Battery of a Thousand Years</a> (Orichalcum Tool, 2) - encased in orichalcum, a small amount of nuclear waste powers a betavoltic current that can power devices with a steady flow of electric charge longer than empires of old took to rise and fall. In addition to powering small devices far from reliable power grids, the wishmetal casing can turn the electricity into motes to power devices that require a the use of a hearthstone. Simply holding the stone in one's personal effects respires an additional two motes of Essence per hour while it powers no other device, but the current is too small and steady for instantaneous tapping.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T18:10:33-07:00","id":1412657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1411292-modern-artifacts?p=1412631#post1412631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Blinks</i><br /> <br /> <b>Hidden Geisha Orbs</b><br /> <br /> The hell, man?</div> </div> </div> </div>Infernal dudes deny any responsability for those - go ask the bluesids, it's more up their....alley. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> In fact some of their studies have revealed, quite, novel, synergies of these with <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crystal_ball\" target=\"_blank\">crystal balls</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bolas\" target=\"_blank\">bolas</a>, leading to the making of some <i>quite original</i> artifacts you're probably better off <b>not </b>knowing.... (the less said of its evocations, the better, i guess) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 09-08-2020, 09:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T04:24:29-07:00","id":1412702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1411292-modern-artifacts?p=1412633#post1412633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://&quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.wired.com/story/are-radioactive-diamond-batteries-a-cure-for-nuclear-waste/&quot;]Battery</a> of a Thousand Years[/URL] (Orichalcum Tool, 2) - encased in orichalcum, a small amount of nuclear waste powers a betavoltic current that can power devices with a steady flow of electric charge longer than empires of old took to rise and fall. In addition to powering small devices far from reliable power grids, the wishmetal casing can turn the electricity into motes to power devices that require a the use of a hearthstone. Simply holding the stone in one's personal effects respires an additional two motes of Essence per hour while it powers no other device, but the current is too small and steady for instantaneous tapping.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder if its possible to make something like this in current exalted...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T08:04:09-07:00","id":1412719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1411292-modern-artifacts?p=1412702#post1412702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if its possible to make something like this in current exalted...</div> </div> </div> </div>In terms of function it\u2019s literally just an artificial hearthstone whose special effect is \u201cIs a thermoelectric generator.\u201d So go find a hearthstone or ask the ST if it\u2019s possible to make one with craft and/or sorcerery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T08:33:46-07:00","id":1412723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1411292-modern-artifacts?p=1412719#post1412719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of function it\u2019s literally just an artificial hearthstone whose special effect is \u201cIs a thermoelectric generator.\u201d So go find a hearthstone or ask the ST if it\u2019s possible to make one with craft and/or sorcerery.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, it's hearthstone literally require a manse and a demense to work. And can be sabotaged. Making stuff like nuclear waste is comparatively easy, just go to Malfeas and grab some green fire, or transmute uranium from iron using mercury ants. <br /> <br /> I think this can be the lynchpin of a new shard. One where magitech is far far more prevalent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T10:08:18-07:00","id":1412736,"title":"","content":"1. Steady hearthstones are a thing.<br /> 2. Acquiring the nuclear waste may or may not be hard but you still have to make a two dot orichalcum artifact out of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-10T17:53:24-07:00","id":1412936,"title":"","content":"Take a look in my signature.<br /> <br /> I got about 20+ more ideas and outlines, but my factory in Factorio doesn't make itself (yet).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-29T12:22:47-07:00","id":1416018,"title":"","content":"I say that you can get lots and lots of things from Technocracy. The feel may be against most of Exalted, but eh, this are modern artifacts. It's too much effort to think of entirely new effects. <br /> <br /> Ideas can involve self-aiming and shooting guns. Snipe rifles capable of burrowing through buildings or mountains. Predictive computers capable of seeing into the future or building up psychological profiles from the barest of information. Canteens of infinite water or pizza boxes of infinite food.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}